('6836790f-c487-5dcd-befd-16276c5d6304'::uuid, 'Executive Order No. 2024-032A: reorganizing the Ormoc City DRRM Council', 'city_issuance', null, 'EO No. 2024-032A', 'Office of the City Mayor', null::date, 'July 2024 (City Legal review 1 Jul 2024). Current CDRRMC composition: Mayor as chair, city offices, national agencies, uniformed services, PRC, 5 CSOs and 2 private-sector seats (3rd blank); functions under RA 10121; quarterly meetings. Supersedes EO 2023-0041.', array['A1.2','A1.3','A1.7','A7.6','A10.2']::text[], 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1p0EsX_F1krNEuHiG4ZiThLnS3qoQAF6i/view', 'Project Drive (CDRRMO folder); scanned copy, text read by OCR', 'current', 'standard', array[]::public.app_role[]),
